WEBVTT

00:00:03.033 --> 00:00:06.239
Narrator: Inspector Granger arrived at about nine o’clock.

00:00:06.853 --> 00:00:11.011
He was a short man with white hair and pale blue eyes.

00:00:11.677 --> 00:00:16.396
Amanda, Barbara, Claudia, and Gordon were in the living room.

00:00:17.397 --> 00:00:19.077
The inspector came in.

00:00:26.769 --> 00:00:31.464
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Mr. Travers died between midnight last night and seven o’clock this morning.

00:00:31.524 --> 00:00:32.331
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> He said.

00:00:33.075 --> 00:00:35.863
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Somebody in this room killed him.

00:00:37.239 --> 00:00:40.888
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> He looked at them one by one, but nobody spoke.

00:00:42.026 --> 00:00:45.209
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Mrs. Travers, I want to talk to you first.

00:00:45.897 --> 00:00:47.637
Come into the study with me, please.

00:00:50.559 --> 00:00:54.646
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> Amanda followed the inspector into the study, and they sat down.

00:00:57.100 --> 00:01:00.522
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> What did your husband do after dinner last night?

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:04.214
<v><b>Amanda:</b></v> We finished dinner at about 9:30.

00:01:04.448 --> 00:01:08.486
Then Jeremy said he was tired and he went to bed.

00:01:08.895 --> 00:01:10.891
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Did you go to bed then?

00:01:11.071 --> 00:01:14.975
<v><b>Amanda:</b></v> No, I didn’t. I went for a walk in the garden.

00:01:15.265 --> 00:01:17.368
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> What time did you go to bed?

00:01:17.519 --> 00:01:20.243
<v><b>Amanda:</b></v> About quarter to twelve.

00:01:20.476 --> 00:01:21.902
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Was your husband asleep?

00:01:22.091 --> 00:01:23.975
<v><b>Amanda:</b></v> I don’t know, Inspector.

00:01:24.305 --> 00:01:27.595
We…we slept in different rooms.

00:01:27.758 --> 00:01:30.314
But I saw that his door was closed.

00:01:30.896 --> 00:01:33.188
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Did you hear anything when you were in your room?

00:01:33.446 --> 00:01:40.141
<v><b>Amanda:</b></v> Yes. I heard Jeremy’s bedroom door. It opened.

00:01:40.338 --> 00:01:44.922
I thought it was Jeremy. Then it closed again.

00:01:46.159 --> 00:01:50.321
I read in bed for half an hour and then I went to sleep.

00:01:53.716 --> 00:01:56.514
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> What time did you get up this morning?

00:01:56.883 --> 00:01:59.767
<v><b>Amanda:</b></v> I got up at about 7:15.

00:02:00.203 --> 00:02:05.161
I had breakfast and at eight o’clock I took a cup of tea to my husband.

00:02:05.884 --> 00:02:11.619
I found him in bed. He was…dead.

00:02:12.406 --> 00:02:17.319
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Tell me, Mrs. Travers, did you love your husband?

00:02:17.534 --> 00:02:21.971
<v><b>Amanda:</b></v> Jeremy is…was a difficult man.

00:02:22.680 --> 00:02:24.688
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> But did you love him, Mrs. Travers?

00:02:25.199 --> 00:02:28.465
<v><b>Amanda:</b></v> No, Inspector. I hated him.